msgid "Static context/face construction and explicit C-call ordering for resource acquisition, startup and reverse cleanup"
msgstr "静态 context/face 构造，以及资源取得、启动和逆序清理的显式 C 调用编排"

msgid "External product"
msgstr "外部产品"

msgid "Execution progress, workers, budgets, partitions and recovery policy"
msgstr "执行进度、工作者、预算、分区与恢复策略"

msgid ""
"Only one state machine may own a live peripheral operation. An adapter must "
"not run a HAL transfer engine and a second independent register engine over "
"the same interrupt flags or DMA channel. Mixed LL/register operations "
"require explicit ordering and ownership. Vendor types, mutable handles and "
"headers stay out of public interfaces. Factory lookup returns an existing "
"face without initializing hardware or allocating storage."
msgstr ""
"一个正在进行的外设操作只能由一个状态机拥有。适配器不得让 HAL 传输引擎与另一套独立寄存器引擎同时处理相同中断标志或 DMA 通道。混合 "
"LL/寄存器操作必须明确顺序与所有权。厂商类型、可变 Handle 和头文件不得进入公共接口。factory 查找返回已有 "
"face，不初始化硬件或分配存储。"

msgid "Build-time provider contract"
msgstr "构建期 provider 合同"

msgid "Each constructor returns the frozen `Construction` record from [provider common contracts](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/providers/common.py). It names `state_type`, `definitions`, `initialize`, `stop`, `retain_on_failed_init`, `exports` and `pin_snapshots`. The common emitter consumes these decisions rather than reconstructing state types or failed-init responsibility from a family name. `initialize` is an immutable `DirectCall`; `stop` is a tuple of these calls. Arguments are explicit static `Symbol` or `Address` values, uint32 constants, booleans, NULL, or nested direct calls such as absolute-deadline construction. Free-form expressions, casts, assignments and function-pointer/member-call expressions reject. `definitions`, `exports` and `face_definitions` remain C source strings for declarations, static configuration, storage, faces and fixed forwarding. Concrete C adapters own hardware algorithms. The real C compiler establishes symbol and parameter types. This is a narrow Python generation contract, not a complete C AST; these Python records introduce no additional runtime metadata or dispatch into the MCU image."
msgstr "每个 constructor 从 [provider 公共合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/providers/common.py)返回冻结的 `Construction` record。它列出 `state_type`、`definitions`、`initialize`、`stop`、`retain_on_failed_init`、`exports` 与 `pin_snapshots`。公共 emitter 消费这些决策，不从 family 名称重建状态类型或 failed-init 责任。`initialize` 是不可变 `DirectCall`；`stop` 是此类调用的 tuple。参数为显式静态 `Symbol` 或 `Address` 值、uint32 常量、boolean、NULL，或绝对 deadline 构造等嵌套直接调用。拒绝自由表达式、cast、assignment 和 function-pointer/member-call expression。`definitions`、`exports` 与 `face_definitions` 仍以 C 源码字符串承载声明、静态配置、存储、face 与固定转发。具体 C adapter 拥有硬件算法。实际 C 编译器确定符号和参数类型。这是窄 Python 生成合同，不是完整 C AST；这些 Python record 不向 MCU 镜像引入额外运行时 metadata 或 dispatch。"

msgid ""
"The family owns numerical limits, supported modes, exact routes and "
"construction semantics. The resolver owns strict fields, immutable inputs "
"and resource conflicts. CMake owns source selection and target dependencies."
" Preserve these separate authorities: generation must not create a second "
"source build graph, and a syntactically valid configuration must not imply "
"unimplemented hardware."
msgstr ""
"家族负责数值限制、支持模式、精确路线与构造语义；resolver 负责严格字段、不可变输入和资源冲突；CMake "
"负责源码选择和目标依赖。必须保留这些独立权威：生成器不得创建第二份源码构建图，配置语法正确也不能表示尚未实现的硬件已经可用。"

msgid "Selected immutable I2C V2 configuration"
msgstr "选定 I2C V2 的不可变配置"

msgid "The selected G474, H743 and U575 polling I2C V2 providers separate the private `nx_i2c_v2_config_t` from `nx_i2c_v2_state_t`. The generated readonly configuration holds register/reset addresses, the reset mask, timing, finite polling budget and the explicitly selected BERR and one-byte RX reload quirks. Zero-initialized runtime storage keeps a configuration pointer and `initialized`, `retained`, `active` and `fault` state. Public faces, shared ops and factory lookup stay the same. This split is not a measured Flash or RAM saving."
msgstr "选定 G474、H743 与 U575 轮询 I2C V2 provider 将私有 `nx_i2c_v2_config_t` 与 `nx_i2c_v2_state_t` 分开。生成的只读配置保存寄存器／复位地址、复位掩码、timing、有限轮询预算，以及显式选择的 BERR 和单字节 RX reload 勘误选项。零初始化的运行时存储保留配置指针和 `initialized`、`retained`、`active`、`fault` 状态。公共 face、共享 ops 和 factory 查找保持不变。该拆分不等于已经测得 Flash 或 RAM 节省。"

msgid "The private `nx_i2c_v2_bind` runs under the serialized privileged task owner with interrupts unmasked. It validates the configuration and rejects overlap with runtime or hardware storage. An initialized, retained or active owner rejects rebinding without mutation; successful binding itself has no hardware effects. The immutable configuration must live as long as its runtime owner; successful stop releases hardware ownership but preserves the binding. Do not reset a live owner merely to replace its configuration."
msgstr "私有 `nx_i2c_v2_bind` 在串行化的特权 Task owner 下执行，且要求中断未屏蔽。它校验配置，并拒绝与运行时或硬件存储重叠。已 initialized、retained 或 active 的 owner 在不修改状态的前提下拒绝重新绑定；成功绑定本身没有硬件效果。不可变配置必须与运行时 owner 同寿命；成功 stop 释放硬件所有权，但保留绑定。不得只为替换配置而重置仍在使用的 owner。"

msgid "Concrete G474/H743 `i2c_prepare` entries bind first, then prepare pins and initialize the engine. U575's separate mutable clock owner rejects a retained clock before binding, and acquires the selected clock before engine initialization. Its `i2c_close` stops the engine first; it releases the clock only after that stop succeeds. Failed drain retains the relevant runtime and clock responsibility for explicit cleanup or retry."
msgstr "具体 G474／H743 `i2c_prepare` 入口先绑定，再准备引脚并初始化引擎。U575 独立的可变 clock owner 在绑定前拒绝 retained clock，并在引擎初始化前取得所选时钟。其 `i2c_close` 先停止引擎；只有该 stop 成功后才释放时钟。排空失败保留相关运行时与时钟责任，供显式清理或重试。"

msgid "The family emitter now supplies static configuration and calls these concrete C entries. The existing `Construction` record and generated Platform still order C calls for resource phases, controller starts and reverse cleanup. Other maintained peripheral modes use their own family static bindings and concrete C preparation; this does not move every platform lifecycle into a new common abstraction."
msgstr "family emitter 现在提供静态配置并调用这些具体 C 入口。现有 `Construction` record 与生成的 Platform 仍对资源阶段、controller 启动和逆序清理的 C 调用进行编排。其他维护的外设模式采用各自 family 静态绑定与具体 C preparation；这不把所有平台生命周期迁入新的公共抽象。"

msgid "See the [private shared contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/drivers/i2c/i2c_v2/i2c_v2.h) and the [U575 integration](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32u575/drivers/i2c.c) for exact parameters and failure ordering. The {download}`refactor ledger <soc-ip-layout-execution.csv>` separates focused software evidence, final linked cost comparison and physical execution."
msgstr "精确参数与失败顺序见[私有共享合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/drivers/i2c/i2c_v2/i2c_v2.h)及 [U575 集成](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32u575/drivers/i2c.c)。{download}`重构台账 <soc-ip-layout-execution.csv>`分别记录聚焦软件证据、最终链接成本比较和物理执行。"

msgid "Selected immutable UART DMA configuration"
msgstr "选定 UART DMA 的不可变配置"

msgid "The selected F103 and GD303 UART DMA modes use `nx_uart_v1_dma_config_t` for register/channel addresses, DMA memory domains, IRQ withdrawal and wake-validation callbacks, byte-ring or duplex receive storage, capacity, baud, IRQ policy and channel shifts. The selected profile identifies the active storage union member. `nx_uart_v1_dma_state_t` retains the configuration pointer, deadlines, active request and wake references, ring cursors, publication state and lifecycle flags. Duplex embeds its own mutable receive extension; byte mode does not reserve one. Configuration and its referenced resources have the runtime owner's lifetime. Successful stop preserves the binding, and zero-initialized runtime binds only during cold admission."
msgstr "选定 F103 与 GD303 UART DMA 模式使用 `nx_uart_v1_dma_config_t` 保存寄存器／channel 地址、DMA 内存域、IRQ 撤下与 wake 校验 callback、字节 ring 或 duplex receive 存储、容量、波特率、IRQ 策略和 channel shift。所选 profile 标识存储 union 的有效成员。`nx_uart_v1_dma_state_t` 保留配置指针、deadline、active request 与 wake 引用、ring 游标、发布状态和生命周期标志。Duplex 内嵌自身可变 receive 扩展；字节模式不预留该扩展。配置及其引用资源与运行时 owner 同寿命。成功 stop 保留绑定，零初始化运行时仅在冷态准入期间绑定。"

msgid "Each family's concrete `uart_dma_prepare` and `uart_duplex_prepare` requires a serialized privileged task with interrupts unmasked. After null/profile checks, it checks the existing cold owner before preparing exact pins and calling the initializer. Retained hardware, active requests, wake publishers and duplex RX loans prevent rebinding; the candidate receive extension is checked even before a configuration is bound. Failed withdrawal retains the same configuration and outstanding loans for ordinary stop or retry. The shared readonly ops, public faces and direct IRQ symbols remain unchanged; no hot-path dispatch layer is added."
msgstr "每个家族的具体 `uart_dma_prepare` 与 `uart_duplex_prepare` 要求串行化特权 Task，且中断未屏蔽。在 null／profile 检查后，先检查既有冷态 owner，再准备精确引脚并调用 initializer。Retained hardware、active request、wake publisher 与 duplex RX loan 阻止重新绑定；即使尚未绑定配置，也会检查候选 receive 扩展。撤下失败保留同一配置及未归还 loan，供普通 stop 或重试。共享只读 ops、公共 face 与直接 IRQ symbol 保持不变；不增加热路径 dispatch 层。"

msgid "The family's frozen `LegacyTransportProfile` supplies exact wiring to the existing emitter without family-name fallback. For these UART modes the selected `Construction.initialize` calls concrete C preparation; generation supplies static configuration, faces and IRQ forwarding. Concrete C adapters now own AHB DMA gates, pin resources and retained cleanup. The generated Platform keeps explicit phase ordering and typed C calls. Legacy I2C V1 and the other maintained peripheral cold paths follow the same C hardware-algorithm boundary."
msgstr "各家族冻结的 `LegacyTransportProfile` 向现有 emitter 提供精确接线，不使用 family-name fallback。对这些 UART 模式，所选 `Construction.initialize` 调用具体 C preparation；生成器提供静态配置、face 与 IRQ 转发。具体 C adapter 现在拥有 AHB DMA gate、pin resource 与保留清理。生成的 Platform 保留显式阶段顺序与 typed C 调用。Legacy I2C V1 及其他维护外设的冷态路径遵守相同的 C 硬件算法边界。"

msgid "See the [UART private contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/drivers/uart/uart_v1_channel_dma/uart_v1_channel_dma.h) for the exact storage, callback and lifetime requirements. Host tests exercise the actual SoC wrapper, shared engine and GPIO model; generated factory validation and final ARM resource measurements remain separate evidence scopes."
msgstr "精确存储、callback 与寿命要求见 [UART 私有合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/drivers/uart/uart_v1_channel_dma/uart_v1_channel_dma.h)。主机测试执行实际 SoC wrapper、共享 engine 与 GPIO model；生成 factory 校验和最终 ARM 资源测量仍是独立证据范围。"


msgid "Selected legacy cold integration"
msgstr "选定 legacy 冷态集成"

msgid "F103 and GD303 keep concrete ADC, PWM and Flash `prepare` entries in their respective `drivers/devices.c`. These privileged task entries require interrupts unmasked and reject the relevant live, retained or faulted owner before replacing its resource binding. The exact C adapter owns register addresses, fixed pin and gate relationships, system-clock state and chip-specific cold checks. Family generation still validates the selected Board/mode and supplies its chosen values. The existing shared `nx_legacy_*_close` paths retain stop and drain responsibility."
msgstr "F103 与 GD303 在各自 `drivers/devices.c` 保留具体 ADC、PWM 和 Flash `prepare` 入口。这些特权 Task 入口要求中断未屏蔽，并在替换资源绑定前拒绝相关 live、retained 或 faulted owner。精确 C adapter 拥有寄存器地址、固定引脚与 gate 关系、system-clock 状态和芯片特定冷态检查。家族生成仍校验所选 Board／模式并提供选定数值。既有共享 `nx_legacy_*_close` 路径保留 stop 与 drain 责任。"

msgid ""
"The ADC and PWM owners now reference their own readonly hardware "
"descriptions, `nx_legacy_adc_config_t` and `nx_legacy_pwm_config_t`, "
"supplied by each exact SoC. Register addresses, gates and fixed pad "
"facts move out of mutable owner storage. ADC reference voltage and PWM "
"tick/period/duty/inactive level remain selected owner state; they are "
"not promoted into shared hardware facts. Configuration must outlive the "
"owner and cannot overlap its state or API output storage. This does not "
"turn these drivers into the I2C V2 type; Flash keeps its separate "
"private contract. Actual linked costs depend on the exact selected "
"image."
msgstr ""
"ADC 和 PWM owner 现在引用各精确 SoC 提供的只读硬件描述 `nx_legacy_adc_config_t` 与 "
"`nx_legacy_pwm_config_t`。寄存器地址、gate 和固定 pad 事实移出可变 owner 存储。ADC 参考电压及 "
"PWM tick／period／duty／inactive level 仍为选定 owner 状态，不提升为共享硬件事实。配置生命周期必须覆盖 "
"owner，且不能与其 state 或 API 输出存储重叠。这不会把驱动变成 I2C V2 类型；Flash "
"保留独立私有合同。实际链接成本取决于精确选定镜像。"

msgid ""
"Selected U575 USART1 `dma-tx` and `dma-chain-tx` use static cold "
"configuration and concrete C preparation. Their C adapters own "
"admission, binding and pin preparation before existing finite/chain "
"initialization. Selected F407 SPI polling/DMA and paired-controller DMA,"
" plus GD470 SPI0/SPI4 polling and finite full-duplex DMA, move "
"prepare/close behavior into concrete C while preserving the same "
"Platform snapshot slots and retained cleanup responsibility. GD470 also "
"moves its conditional EXTI close into C. The hot transfer engines, "
"public faces and direct IRQ ownership are unchanged."
msgstr ""
"选定 U575 USART1 `dma-tx` 与 `dma-chain-tx` 使用静态冷态配置和具体 C prepare。C 适配器在既有 "
"finite/chain 初始化前负责准入、绑定与引脚准备。选定 F407 SPI 轮询／DMA、成对控制器 DMA，以及 GD470 "
"SPI0/SPI4 轮询和有限全双工 DMA，将 prepare/close 行为移入具体 C，同时保留原 Platform snapshot "
"槽及失败后保留的清理责任。GD470 的条件 EXTI close 也迁入 C。热路径传输引擎、公共 face 和直接 IRQ 所有权不变。"

msgid "The maintained Native, F103, F407, G474, H743, U575, GD303 and GD470 selections now keep hardware algorithms in C11, including selected GPIO, IRQ UART, ADC, PWM, EXTI, preflight, shared resources and retained cleanup. Host Python supplies static configuration, storage, faces and fixed typed calls; the generated Platform still owns explicit startup and reverse-cleanup ordering. Review the actual selected C path rather than inferring support from a call field or directory. The {ref}`sealed cold-lifecycle baseline <sealed-cold-lifecycle-baseline>` records the exact final source and software evidence; physical timing remains unexecuted."
msgstr "维护的 Native、F103、F407、G474、H743、U575、GD303 与 GD470 选择现在均把硬件算法保留在 C11，包括选定 GPIO、IRQ UART、ADC、PWM、EXTI、preflight、共享资源与保留清理。主机 Python 提供静态配置、存储、face 与固定 typed 调用；生成的 Platform 仍拥有显式启动和逆序清理编排。应审查实际选定的 C 路径，不从 call field 或目录推导支持。{ref}`封存的冷态生命周期基线 <sealed-cold-lifecycle-baseline>`记录精确最终源码与软件证据；物理时序仍未执行。"

msgid "Conditions for full HAL transport"
msgstr "完整 HAL transport 的接入条件"

msgid ""
"Before accepting a Handle-based mode, establish a progressing time source "
"for every HAL wait it can reach. Review bootstrap clock waits, "
"`HAL_GetTick`, tick reinitialization and interrupt-priority grouping. Do not"
" let default HAL startup silently acquire SysTick or change OS policy. "
"Public operations consume one absolute monotonic deadline, including queue "
"and preparation time."
msgstr ""
"接受基于 Handle 的模式前，为其可能进入的每个 HAL 等待建立能够推进的时源。审查 bootstrap "
"时钟等待、`HAL_GetTick`、tick 重新初始化和中断优先级分组。不得让默认 HAL 启动静默取得 SysTick 或改变 OS "
"策略。公共操作使用同一个绝对单调 deadline，包含排队和准备时间。"

msgid ""
"Establish request identity and borrowed references before enabling hardware "
"or calling an API that can invoke a callback synchronously. Callback bridges"
" publish bounded facts and optional wake hints; they do not execute "
"arbitrary product callbacks. Check the complete HAL call stack before "
"publishing settlement or allowing reentrant submission. A HAL lock is not a "
"task mutex or a controller ownership policy."
msgstr ""
"启用硬件或调用可能同步触发回调的 API 前，先建立 request "
"身份与借用引用。回调桥只发布有界事实和可选唤醒提示，不执行任意产品回调。发布结清或允许重入提交前，必须检查完整 HAL 调用栈。HAL lock "
"不是任务互斥锁，也不能代替控制器所有权策略。"

msgid ""
"![Reference finite-DMA completion and failure "
"responsibilities](../assets/diagrams/dma-completion.svg)"
msgstr "![有限 DMA 完成与失败责任参考](../assets/diagrams/dma-completion.svg)"

msgid "Reference finite-DMA completion and failure responsibilities"
msgstr "有限 DMA 完成与失败责任参考"

msgid ""
"FIG-07 is the existing F407 finite-DMA reference. DMA completion, wire "
"completion, HAL internal readiness and Nexus settlement remain different "
"facts. Preserve the [public ownership "
"contract](../explanation/ownership.md): abort or timeout starts withdrawal; "
"it does not return storage. Detach every required hardware, IRQ and queue "
"reference before the provider's final release-publication of `SETTLED`. "
"Failed drain retains `QUARANTINED` storage and an explicit recovery "
"obligation. Circular DMA must never overwrite a consumer-owned block to "
"emulate progress."
msgstr ""
"FIG-07 是既有 F407 有限 DMA 参考。DMA 完成、线上完成、HAL 内部就绪与 Nexus "
"结清仍是不同事实。保留[公共所有权合同](../explanation/ownership.md)：abort 或 timeout "
"启动撤回，不归还存储。provider 最终以 release 发布 `SETTLED` 前，先撤回全部必要硬件、IRQ 与队列引用。排空失败保留 "
"`QUARANTINED` 存储和明确恢复责任。循环 DMA 不得覆盖消费者持有的块来模拟进展。"

msgid "Caller-owned lifecycle diagnostics"
msgstr "调用方存储的生命周期诊断"

msgid ""
"Generated headers expose `nx_platform_diagnostic_t` and the optional "
"`nx_platform_start_diagnosed` / `nx_platform_stop_diagnosed` entries. The "
"original start/stop entry points remain available. A null diagnostic pointer"
" uses the original behavior; a nonnull pointer supplies caller-owned cold-"
"path output and is never retained. It adds no static registry, labels or "
"default instance RAM. Cold code/stack cost still belongs in the linked-image"
" comparison."
msgstr ""
"生成的头提供 `nx_platform_diagnostic_t` 和可选 `nx_platform_start_diagnosed` / "
"`nx_platform_stop_diagnosed` 入口，原 start/stop "
"入口继续可用。空诊断指针使用原行为；非空指针提供调用方拥有的冷路径输出，不会被保留。它不增加静态注册表、标签或默认实例 "
"RAM。冷路径代码和栈成本仍需要纳入实际链接镜像比较。"

msgid ""
"`phase` and `cleanup_phase` distinguish `NONE`, `CONTEXT`, `SYSTEM`, "
"`RESOURCES` and `CONTROLLER`. A controller phase carries its zero-based "
"index in `resolved.json.controllers`; it is not a per-kind factory ID. "
"`SIZE_MAX` means no controller. Successful calls clear the diagnostic. A "
"failed start records the primary location and, if cleanup fails, a separate "
"cleanup location. Existing primary result, cleanup result and remaining "
"effects remain authoritative; diagnostics neither perform recovery nor "
"establish that a retained borrow ended."
msgstr ""
"`phase` 与 `cleanup_phase` 区分 `NONE`、`CONTEXT`、`SYSTEM`、`RESOURCES` 和 "
"`CONTROLLER`。controller 阶段携带其在 `resolved.json.controllers` 中的零基索引，不是各 kind 的"
" factory ID。`SIZE_MAX` 表示没有 "
"controller。调用成功清空诊断；启动失败记录主要位置，清理失败时另记录清理位置。既有主要结果、清理结果与剩余效果继续是权威；诊断不执行恢复，也不证明保留的借用已经结束。"

msgid "Work-package exits and existing authorities"
msgstr "工作包退出条件与既有权威"

msgid ""
"The following table assigns exits to the iteration work packages. It is a "
"design checklist, not a second support or completion database. Current "
"support continues to come from [the derived capability "
"matrix](../delivery/capabilities.md), exact provider facts and reviewed "
"fixtures. Existing ledgers retain original IDs, statuses and evidence; do "
"not relabel historical results as new-source execution."
msgstr ""
"下表为迭代工作包规定退出条件，是设计检查表，不是第二份支持或完成数据库。当前支持继续来自[派生能力矩阵](../delivery/capabilities.md)、精确"
" provider facts 和已审查夹具。既有台账保留原始 ID、状态与证据，不得把历史结果重标为新源码执行。"

msgid "Work package"
msgstr "工作包"

msgid "Exit and maintained authority"
msgstr "退出条件与维护权威"

msgid "Configuration and provider contract"
msgstr "配置与 provider 合同"

msgid ""
"Explicit construction and failed-init responsibility; deterministic "
"generation and rejection tests; [integration contract](integration-"
"contracts.md)"
msgstr "明确构造与初始化失败责任；确定性生成及拒绝测试；[接入合同](integration-contracts.md)"

msgid "Official driver reuse"
msgstr "官方驱动复用"

msgid ""
"Locked source/license/pairing, private build and SDK closure, mode-specific "
"real-driver tests; [source compatibility](source-compatibility.md)"
msgstr "锁定来源、许可证与配对，私有构建和 SDK 闭包，逐模式真实驱动测试；[源码兼容性](source-compatibility.md)"

msgid "Hardware/resource description"
msgstr "硬件与资源描述"

msgid ""
"Exact pins, IRQ, DMA, clocks and memory; no invented Board wiring or silent "
"fallback; [SoC ledger](soc-refinement.md)"
msgstr ""
"精确 pins、IRQ、DMA、clock 与 memory；不虚构 Board 接线，不静默回退；[SoC 台账](soc-"
"refinement.md)"

msgid "Lifecycle and diagnostics"
msgstr "生命周期与诊断"

msgid ""
"Every partial effect either withdrawn or retained; caller-owned cold "
"diagnostics never revoke a borrow; [lifecycle matrix](io-lifecycle-"
"matrix.md)"
msgstr "部分效果要么撤回，要么继续保留；调用方存储的冷路径诊断不撤销借用；[生命周期矩阵](io-lifecycle-matrix.md)"

msgid "I/O ownership"
msgstr "I/O 所有权"

msgid ""
"Real acceptance, cancel, late IRQ, overflow, instance isolation and drain "
"regressions; [I/O recovery contract](io-observation-recovery.md)"
msgstr "真实接受、取消、晚到 IRQ、溢出、实例隔离与排空回归；[I/O 恢复合同](io-observation-recovery.md)"

msgid "Arch, OS and components"
msgstr "Arch、OS 与组件"

msgid ""
"Exact backend/CPU scope, unchanged masks, explicit execution and "
"wait/observer shutdown; [OS contract](os-contracts.md)"
msgstr ""
"精确 backend/CPU 范围、不改变输入 mask、显式执行与 wait/observer 退出；[OS 合同](os-contracts.md)"

msgid "Performance and resources"
msgstr "性能与资源"

msgid ""
"Same configuration/toolchain/workload comparison, actual ELF/RAM/stack "
"reports; [execution budgets](soc-execution-budgets.md)"
msgstr "同配置、工具链和负载比较，真实 ELF/RAM/stack 报告；[执行预算](soc-execution-budgets.md)"

msgid "Test plan and HIL"
msgstr "测试计划与 HIL"

msgid ""
"Reviewed applicability plus fresh executed results; software and physical "
"status separate; [qualification](../delivery/qualification.md)"
msgstr "审查适用范围并取得新鲜执行结果，软件与物理状态分别记录；[资格合同](../delivery/qualification.md)"

msgid "External consumption and documentation"
msgstr "外部消费与文档"

msgid ""
"Relocated Source SDK consumer, external examples and complete reviewed "
"English/Chinese pages; {download}`build ledger <build-system-execution.csv>`"
" and {download}`documentation ledger <documentation-system-execution.csv>`"
msgstr ""
"搬移后的 Source SDK consumer、外部示例以及完整已审英文与中文页面；{download}`构建台账 <build-system-"
"execution.csv>`和{download}`文档台账 <documentation-system-execution.csv>`"

msgid ""
"The read-only work-package view joins existing provider, capability, SDK-"
"required source and reviewed lifecycle-test authorities. It retains exact "
"scopes and shows unmapped properties instead of inventing aliases. It does "
"not execute tests, verify a complete installed SDK or establish "
"software/physical qualification. See [maintenance "
"tools](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tools/maintenance/README.md) for the actual command and output "
"limits."
msgstr ""
"只读工作包视图关联既有 provider、能力、SDK "
"必需源码和已审生命周期测试权威。它保留精确范围，展示未映射属性，不虚构别名。它不执行测试、不验证完整已安装 "
"SDK，也不建立软件或物理资格。实际命令与输出限制见[维护工具](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/maintenance/README.md)。"

msgid "Comparison and replacement"
msgstr "比较与替换"

msgid ""
"Compare official and existing implementations with the same chip, clock, "
"memory, route, mode, capacity, OS, compiler, optimization and workload. "
"Record Flash LOAD and footprint separately, per-domain static RAM, caller-"
"owned storage, stack reservation versus measured peak, IRQ/service behavior "
"and cleanup failures. Operation counts and host timings are not physical "
"cycles, latency or WCET."
msgstr ""
"比较官方与既有实现时，固定芯片、clock、memory、route、mode、capacity、OS、compiler、optimization 和 "
"workload。分别记录 Flash LOAD 与 footprint、各域静态 RAM、调用方存储、预留栈与实测峰值、IRQ/service "
"行为和清理失败。操作次数与主机耗时不是物理 cycles、latency 或 WCET。"

msgid ""
"Retain an old implementation only while it provides a needed comparison or "
"an unreplaced maintained mode. Select one normal production implementation "
"after its contract and costs are accepted; remove unused switches and "
"duplicate state. A dedicated LL/register path is justified by a demonstrated"
" semantic gap or measured budget, not by a general assertion that vendor "
"code is slow."
msgstr ""
"只有仍需对照或存在未替代维护模式时才保留旧实现。合同与成本验收后，选定一个正常生产实现，删除无用开关和重复状态。专用 "
"LL/寄存器路径需要已证明的语义差距或实测预算依据，不能只笼统声称厂商代码慢。"

msgid "Validation and delivery boundary"
msgstr "验证与交付边界"

msgid ""
"New behavior follows RED, GREEN and refactor with the normal commit/CI "
"gates. Host C tests use GoogleTest/GoogleMock; tool tests use stdlib "
"unittest. Mock an external port when checking the adapter contract, then "
"separately execute real official code with the adapter. ARM links establish "
"selected image/resource properties. Real equipment is required for IRQ "
"timing, DMA/Cache coherence, electrical behavior and long-load conclusions."
msgstr ""
"新增行为按 RED、GREEN、refactor 实施，并通过正常 commit/CI 门禁。主机 C 测试使用 "
"GoogleTest/GoogleMock，工具测试使用 stdlib unittest。适配合同测试可以 mock "
"外部端口，然后还要单独执行真实官方代码与适配器。ARM 链接证明所选镜像与资源性质；IRQ 时序、DMA/Cache "
"一致性、电气行为和长期负载结论需要真实设备。"

msgid ""
"A software candidate still requires clean source, exact "
"dependency/configuration identity, independent SDK consumption and two fresh"
" network-disabled builds of the same artifacts. No iteration checklist or "
"derived work-package report grants that status. Existing release tags/assets"
" and original evidence remain immutable. Without connected boards, HIL stays"
" `not_executed`; do not call a software-only iteration a product release or "
"safety qualification."
msgstr ""
"软件候选仍要求 clean source、精确依赖和配置身份、独立 SDK "
"消费，以及同产物的两次全新断网构建。迭代检查表或派生工作包报告均不授予这一状态。既有 release "
"tag、附件和原始证据保持不可变。没有连接实板时，HIL 保持 `not_executed`，不得把纯软件迭代称为产品发布或安全资格。"

msgid ""
"Bootloader handoff, dynamic reclocking, deep STOP, broader H743 DMA and "
"generic U575 cross-domain I/O retain their separate unimplemented or partial"
" exits in the [SoC refinement ledger](soc-refinement.md). Official drivers "
"do not automatically supply the platform contracts for these features."
msgstr ""
"Bootloader 交接、动态变频、deep STOP、更广的 H743 DMA 和通用 U575 跨域 I/O，继续保留[SoC "
"完善台账](soc-refinement.md)中各自未实现或部分实现的退出条件。官方驱动不会自动提供这些功能需要的平台合同。"

msgid "Vendor-first target and current implementation"
msgstr "官方库优先目标与当前实现"

msgid "Official hardware libraries are the default input for further provider work. Reuse reviewed HAL transport when it satisfies the complete selected mode; otherwise bind suitable LL or SPL primitives to the required bounded mechanism. Nexus retains admission, borrowed storage, deadlines, result publication and resource responsibility. Direct register helpers remain justified exceptions for an exact SDK gap, erratum, atomic operation or demonstrated budget."
msgstr "官方硬件库是后续 provider 工作的默认输入。已审查 HAL transport 满足完整所选模式时予以复用；否则将合适的 LL 或 SPL 原语静态绑定到所需有界机制。Nexus 保留准入、借用存储、deadline、结果发布和资源责任。直接寄存器 helper 仅作为精确 SDK 缺口、erratum、原子操作或实测预算的有理由例外。"

msgid "The {download}`existing delivery-completion ledger <platform-delivery-completion.csv>` appends V-A01 through V-L08, V-P01 through V-P06 and V-X01 through V-X04 while preserving the older rows and frozen results. Each new row starts with its real implementation, software and physical status; a plan has no execution evidence. The [derived ledger view](../status/ledgers/platform-delivery-completion.md) uses the same renderer. No second support or completion database is introduced."
msgstr "{download}`现有交付完善台账 <platform-delivery-completion.csv>`追加 V-A01 至 V-L08、V-P01 至 V-P06 及 V-X01 至 V-X04，保留旧记录和冻结结果。各新记录分别保留真实实现、软件和物理状态；计划没有执行证据。[派生台账视图](../status/ledgers/platform-delivery-completion.md)继续使用同一 renderer，不引入第二套支持或完成状态数据库。"

msgid "Boundary"
msgstr "边界"

msgid "Required responsibility"
msgstr "必需责任"

msgid "Official transport"
msgstr "官方 transport"

msgid "Own the selected peripheral transfer, IRQ/DMA and vendor state machine"
msgstr "拥有所选外设传输、IRQ/DMA 和 vendor 状态机"

msgid "LL/SPL primitive"
msgstr "LL/SPL 原语"

msgid "Encode reviewed hardware operations without claiming a complete transport"
msgstr "封装已审查硬件操作，不据此宣称完整 transport"

msgid "Nexus adapter"
msgstr "Nexus adapter"

msgid "Bridge admission, borrow, absolute deadline, errors, callbacks, drain and final settlement"
msgstr "桥接准入、借用、绝对 deadline、错误、callback、排空和最终结清"

msgid "Exact SoC"
msgstr "精确 SoC"

msgid "Bind SDK pairing, clock/reset, IRQ/DMA route, memory/Cache and silicon restrictions"
msgstr "绑定 SDK 配对、clock/reset、IRQ/DMA 路由、memory/Cache 和芯片限制"

msgid "Board/product"
msgstr "Board/产品"

msgid "Supply reviewed wiring, electrical state, execution, storage, partitions and recovery policy"
msgstr "提供已审查接线、电气状态、执行、存储、分区及恢复策略"

msgid "Static assembly"
msgstr "静态装配"

msgid "Construct existing contexts/faces and fixed IRQ connections; select one implementation before execution"
msgstr "构造已有 context/face 和固定 IRQ 连接；在执行前选择一个实现"

msgid "A private Handle can live in static provider storage. A public face still calls its selected immutable ops with that instance context. No universal HAL manager, name registry, default worker or extra forwarding-only layer is required. One live controller behavior domain has one hardware transport owner. Selecting HAL transport replaces the corresponding independent register transport; Handle readiness and Nexus request lifetime remain different contracts."
msgstr "私有 Handle 可以位于静态 provider 存储中。公共 face 继续使用实例 context 调用所选不可变 ops。无需通用 HAL manager、名字注册表、默认 worker 或仅转发的额外层。一个活动控制器行为域只有一个硬件 transport owner。选入 HAL transport 后替换对应的独立寄存器 transport；Handle 就绪和 Nexus 请求生命周期仍是不同合同。"

msgid "Complete maintained scope"
msgstr "完整维护范围"

msgid "The iteration covers the existing exact selections for STM32F103, STM32F407, STM32G474, STM32H743, STM32U575, GD32F303 and GD32F470. The three launch Boards are Qiming F407ZGT6, Sky F407VET6 and Liangshan GD32F470ZGT6. Current Sky bindings cover LED, UART, Flash and IWDG; additional electrical routes need review before physical execution."
msgstr "本轮覆盖 STM32F103、STM32F407、STM32G474、STM32H743、STM32U575、GD32F303 和 GD32F470 的既有精确选择。三块首发 Board 是启明 F407ZGT6、天空星 F407VET6 和梁山派 GD32F470ZGT6。天空星当前 binding 覆盖 LED、UART、Flash 和 IWDG；新增电气路由在物理执行前需要审查。"

msgid "The 71-entry assembly catalogue is one input, not the complete closure. Derive navigation from the existing capability/provider/source catalogues, provider fixtures, installed-SDK consumers, selected components and external examples. The maintained `tools/maintenance/work_packages.py` joins existing authorities; it does not execute tests or grant support. A mode needs its exact part/density, Board/revision, route, backend/kernel policy, clock, format, IRQ/DMA, memory/Cache/security/power profile and SDK pin reviewed together. CPU-only Arch coverage and the independent ThreadX subset do not expand this SoC matrix."
msgstr "含 71 项的装配 catalogue 是一个输入，不是完整闭包。导航由现有 capability/provider/source catalogue、provider 夹具、已安装 SDK consumer、所选组件及外部示例派生。维护中的 `tools/maintenance/work_packages.py` 联查既有权威，不执行测试或授予支持。一个模式需要共同审查精确料号/density、Board/revision、route、backend/kernel policy、clock、format、IRQ/DMA、memory/Cache/security/power profile 和 SDK pin。CPU-only Arch 覆盖与独立 ThreadX 子集不扩大该 SoC 矩阵。"

msgid "F103/GD303 errata, F407/GD470 stream DMA, G474 DMAMUX and trigger coupling, H743 Cache/domains/wire completion, and U575 GPDMA/retention/TrustZone retain separate checks. A finite HAL UART result cannot qualify FIFO, continuous, chained, duplex or cross-domain operation."
msgstr "F103/GD303 errata、F407/GD470 stream DMA、G474 DMAMUX 与触发耦合、H743 Cache/域/线上完成以及 U575 GPDMA/保留/TrustZone 分别验证。有限 HAL UART 结果不能授予 FIFO、连续、链式、双向或跨域操作资格。"

msgid "Production promotion gates"
msgstr "生产推广门槛"

msgid "The serialized reference's `hal_depth` IRQ guard is not an MCU preemption design. Production must establish allowed HAL nesting, short guards, pending-fact handling and real IRQ service ordering. Do not mask all interrupts around vendor calls that may wait. An abort callback can run synchronously in task context; bridges record bounded facts and use notification permitted in the actual context. Product callbacks and final settlement do not run arbitrarily inside vendor callback stacks."
msgstr "串行参考的 `hal_depth` IRQ guard 不是 MCU 抢占设计。生产实现必须明确允许的 HAL 嵌套、短 guard、pending-fact 处理和真实 IRQ 服务顺序。不得在可能等待的 vendor 调用周围屏蔽全部中断。abort callback 可以在 task 上下文同步执行；桥接记录有界事实，并使用实际上下文允许的通知。产品 callback 和最终结清不能任意在 vendor callback 调用栈内执行。"

msgid "A Handle-only callback does not carry a request epoch. Before Handle reuse, prove withdrawal of the previous hardware, IRQ and callback references; stamping the current epoch onto a late callback is not proof of association. Establish admission before a vendor call can retain references, and treat a startup error after admission as accepted work requiring explicit withdrawal."
msgstr "仅携带 Handle 的 callback 没有请求 epoch。复用 Handle 前必须证明上一次硬件、IRQ 和 callback 引用已撤离；将当前 epoch 填入迟到 callback 不能证明其关联。在 vendor 调用可能保留引用前建立 admission；admission 后的启动错误属于已接受工作，需要明确撤离。"

msgid "Review every reachable vendor wait, including bootstrap/runtime progression, millisecond quantization, 32-bit tick wrap and low-power suspension. Initial UART work keeps the existing system-clock and OS startup choices. Selected HAL modules do not authorize default SysTick acquisition or interrupt-policy changes. UART/SPI `uint16_t Size` parameters must match the selected public `size_t` contract without truncation, hidden splitting or implicit bounce storage."
msgstr "审核每条可达 vendor 等待，包括 bootstrap/runtime 推进、毫秒量化、32 位 tick 回绕和低功耗暂停。首批 UART 工作保留既有系统时钟和 OS 启动选择。所选 HAL 模块不授权默认获取 SysTick 或更改中断策略。UART/SPI 的 `uint16_t Size` 参数必须匹配所选公共 `size_t` 合同，不能截断、隐藏分块或隐式提供 bounce 存储。"

msgid "Ordered implementation and acceptance"
msgstr "实施顺序与验收"

msgid "Phase"
msgstr "阶段"

msgid "Ledger work"
msgstr "台账工作"

msgid "Exit"
msgstr "退出条件"

msgid "G0"
msgstr "G0"

msgid "V-A: exact scope and contract"
msgstr "V-A：精确范围与合同"

msgid "Every maintained selection has a bounded migration decision and baseline"
msgstr "每个维护选择具有有界迁移决策和基线"

msgid "G1"
msgstr "G1"

msgid "V-B/V-C/V-D: dependencies and integration"
msgstr "V-B/V-C/V-D：依赖与集成"

msgid "Private SDK build, static contexts, resource responsibility, time and IRQ contracts are established"
msgstr "建立私有 SDK 构建、静态 context、资源责任、时间及 IRQ 合同"

msgid "G2"
msgstr "G2"

msgid "V-E and first GD32 work"
msgstr "V-E 与首批 GD32 工作"

msgid "Complete F407 UART behavior and selected GD32 official primitives execute their real regressions"
msgstr "完整 F407 UART 行为和所选 GD32 官方原语实际执行其回归"

msgid "G3"
msgstr "G3"

msgid "V-F/V-G/V-H/V-I"
msgstr "V-F/V-G/V-H/V-I"

msgid "Each applicable peripheral/family has a reviewed implementation and comparable cost; unused replaced production paths are removed"
msgstr "每个适用外设/家族具有已审查实现和可比较成本；移除已替换且不再使用的生产路径"

msgid "G4"
msgstr "G4"

msgid "V-J/V-K"
msgstr "V-J/V-K"

msgid "Test contexts, relocated SDK consumers, external examples and both documentation languages agree"
msgstr "测试上下文、可重定位 SDK consumer、外部示例和两种文档语言一致"

msgid "G5"
msgstr "G5"

msgid "V-L"
msgstr "V-L"

msgid "Clean source P, examples E, dependencies, configuration and original artifacts are associated without inheriting old qualification"
msgstr "干净源码 P、示例 E、依赖、配置和原始产物关联，不继承旧资格"

msgid "G6"
msgstr "G6"

msgid "V-P/V-X"
msgstr "V-P/V-X"

msgid "Connected physical execution and actual external environment/publication exits are observed separately"
msgstr "分别观测已连接设备的物理执行与真实外部环境/发布退出"

msgid "Keep developer tests focused, execute the ordinary complete-index gate for each functional increment, and run the complete qualification plan for the frozen source. New behavior and fixes require actual RED then GREEN. Pure equivalent refactors use the applicable regressions and output checks without fabricated RED failures. Firmware remains C11; GoogleTest/GoogleMock remains host-only. Preserve original attempts and compare complete providers, not only Handle sizes. Without connected equipment, physical rows remain `not_executed`."
msgstr "开发测试保持聚焦，每个功能增量执行普通完整 index 门禁，冻结源码执行完整资格计划。新行为与修复要求实际 RED 后 GREEN。纯等价重构使用适用回归和输出检查，不制造 RED 失败。固件保持 C11；GoogleTest/GoogleMock 仅用于 host。保留原始执行，比较完整 provider，不只比较 Handle 大小。未连接设备时，物理记录保持 `not_executed`。"


msgid "Selected F407VE/ZG and GD470 offset images now have reviewed configuration, startup, vector/linker and ELF-to-BIN boundaries; the [assembly reference](../reference/configuration/assembly.md#physical-flash-and-the-selected-image) distinguishes their image window from complete physical Flash. This is not boot authentication, Flash access control or running-image handoff qualification. The F407 handoff retains PRIMASK=1 and startup does not unmask it; an offset FreeRTOS link cannot establish a valid FreeRTOS handoff."
msgstr "所选 F407VE/ZG 和 GD470 偏移镜像已有已审查的配置、startup、向量/linker 及 ELF-to-BIN 边界；[装配参考](../reference/configuration/assembly.md#physical-flash-and-the-selected-image)区分镜像窗口和完整物理 Flash。这不是启动认证、Flash 访问控制或运行态镜像交接资格。F407 handoff 保留 PRIMASK=1，startup 不主动解除屏蔽；偏移 FreeRTOS 链接不能建立有效 FreeRTOS handoff。"


msgid "The selected F407 UART `dma-tx` provider uses official HAL finite TX with a disjoint LL IRQ receiver under one private owner. Other F407 UART modes retain their existing engines; G4, H7 and U5 retain their reviewed LL integrations. GD32F470 compiles selected official SPL C units. Source selection, model tests, ARM links and physical execution remain separate evidence. An include, primitive call or finite-TX fixture alone does not establish a complete transport or family qualification."
msgstr "所选 F407 UART `dma-tx` provider 在一个私有 owner 内使用官方 HAL 有限 TX 和分离的 LL IRQ 接收器。其他 F407 UART 模式保留既有引擎；G4、H7 和 U5 保留已审查的 LL 集成。GD32F470 编译所选官方 SPL C 单元。源码选择、模型测试、ARM 链接和物理执行仍是分别取得的证据。仅 include、原语调用或有限 TX 夹具不能建立完整 transport 或系列资格。"

msgid "The selected F407 `dma-tx` implementation preserves the complete mode, including IRQ RX bytes/events, frame/error/loss ordering, timestamps, wake and storage. HAL owns finite TX DMA, the UART TC completion sequence and transmit abort; the private provider owns their integration with the disjoint LL receiver and Nexus lifetime. The older serialized finite-TX reference remains evaluation evidence for its narrower contract, not the production mode's qualification. Other modes require their own complete evaluation before replacement."
msgstr "所选 F407 `dma-tx` 实现保留完整模式，包括 IRQ RX byte/event、frame/error/loss 顺序、时间戳、wake 和存储。HAL 拥有有限 TX DMA、UART TC 完成顺序和 TX abort；私有 provider 负责它们与分离的 LL 接收器及 Nexus 生命周期的集成。较早的串行有限 TX reference 仍只为其较窄合同提供评估证据，不是生产模式的资格。其他模式替换前须分别完成完整评估。"

msgid "The reviewed F4 dependency is STM32 HAL Driver v1.8.5 at `b6f0ed3829f3829eb358a2e7417d80bba1a42db7`. Its CMSIS Device pairing comes from STM32CubeF4 v1.28.3. The machine authority is [the official-driver lock](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/dependencies/stm32f4-hal.lock.json), checked against the selected Git dependency and imported SDK bytes. The selected API is `stm32f407-ll-inline-eth-definitions-uart-dma-hal-tx`. Its 25-file closure retains the earlier LL/ETH definitions and license, and adds the reviewed HAL headers plus UART, DMA and RCC C units. GPIO/Flash declarations are required by RCC compilation; their C implementations, PWR and global `stm32f4xx_hal.c` are not selected. This lock is not a declaration that all HAL modules are supported or validated."
msgstr "已审查的 F4 依赖是 STM32 HAL Driver v1.8.5，提交为 `b6f0ed3829f3829eb358a2e7417d80bba1a42db7`。其 CMSIS Device 配对来自 STM32CubeF4 v1.28.3。机器权威是[官方驱动 lock](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/dependencies/stm32f4-hal.lock.json)，对照所选 Git 依赖和导入 SDK 字节校验。所选 API 为 `stm32f407-ll-inline-eth-definitions-uart-dma-hal-tx`。其 25 文件闭包保留原 LL/ETH 定义和许可证，并增加已审查 HAL 头文件及 UART、DMA、RCC C 单元。RCC 编译需要 GPIO/Flash 声明；不选入其 C 实现、PWR 或全局 `stm32f4xx_hal.c`。这个 lock 不声明所有 HAL 模块均受支持或已验证。"

msgid "F407 uses official LL operations inside its existing provider state machines, with one selected HAL transport for UART `dma-tx`. That transport retains request admission, absolute deadlines, wire completion, cancellation, drain and quarantine. It does not replace F407 IRQ-word, IRQ-block, RX-DMA or duplex providers. G4, H7 and U5 do not inherit F4 support or dependency qualification. GD32 remains a separate provider."
msgstr "F407 在既有 provider 状态机内部使用官方 LL 操作，并为 UART `dma-tx` 选择一个 HAL transport。该 transport 保留请求准入、绝对 deadline、线上完成、取消、drain 和 quarantine。它不替换 F407 IRQ-word、IRQ-block、RX-DMA 或 duplex provider。G4、H7 和 U5 不继承 F4 支持或依赖资格。GD32 仍是独立 provider。"

msgid "Selected F407 HAL UART transport"
msgstr "所选 F407 HAL UART transport"

msgid "The same authored `dma-tx` mode selects a static private owner, immutable cold configuration, one `UART_HandleTypeDef`, one `DMA_HandleTypeDef` and a shared readonly Nexus ops table. The factory still returns the existing Nexus face; neither vendor types nor callback registration become a public interface. The private callback ABI sets `USE_HAL_UART_REGISTER_CALLBACKS=1` consistently for the adapter and selected official C units. TX completion/error/transmit-abort/MSP and TX half-transfer callbacks are explicitly bound per Handle, without a global product callback override or runtime controller registry."
msgstr "同一个用户编写的 `dma-tx` 模式选择静态私有 owner、不可变冷态配置、一个 `UART_HandleTypeDef`、一个 `DMA_HandleTypeDef` 和共享 readonly Nexus ops 表。factory 仍返回既有 Nexus face；vendor 类型和 callback 注册都不成为公共接口。私有 callback ABI 在 adapter 和所选官方 C 单元中一致设置 `USE_HAL_UART_REGISTER_CALLBACKS=1`。TX completion/error/transmit-abort/MSP 及 TX half-transfer callback 逐 Handle 显式绑定，不提供全局产品 callback 覆盖或运行时控制器 registry。"

msgid "One provider owns both UART behavior domains. The LL receiver consumes RX status/data once, then temporarily masks RXNE/parity/error enables while `HAL_UART_IRQHandler` observes TX facts. HAL receive state remains idle, RX buffer/size/count and `hdmarx` remain empty, and DMAR stays clear. This prevents HAL error/abort paths from claiming the IRQ receiver. An unexpected receive domain or Handle/route identity change closes admission and retains quarantine; it does not adopt or abort a foreign DMA owner."
msgstr "一个 provider 拥有 UART 的两个行为域。LL 接收器只消费一次 RX status/data，随后在 `HAL_UART_IRQHandler` 观察 TX 事实期间暂时屏蔽 RXNE/parity/error enable。HAL receive state 保持 idle，RX buffer/size/count 与 `hdmarx` 保持空，DMAR 保持清零。这样 HAL error/abort 路径不会认领 IRQ 接收器。意外的接收域或 Handle/route 身份变化会关闭准入并保留 quarantine；它不会接管或 abort 其他 DMA owner。"

msgid "Admission establishes the request and payload borrow before a HAL call can retain them or invoke a synchronous callback. Callbacks latch bounded facts; task service alone withdraws transfer pointers and publishes final settlement. DMA completion still differs from UART TC and from full reference withdrawal. Cancel, timeout and deinitialization failures retain the request or cold lease until the same owner proves actual drain. Stop checks peripheral enables, DMA addresses/counts and pending/active IRQ references before releasing pins or clocks. A Handle is reused only after this withdrawal; official `HAL_DMA_Init` restores the reusable idle state where required, without assigning READY by hand."
msgstr "准入在 HAL 调用可能保留引用或同步 callback 之前建立 request 和 payload 借用。callback 锁存有界事实；只有 task service 才撤回传输指针并发布最终 settlement。DMA 完成仍不同于 UART TC，也不同于全部引用撤回。取消、timeout 和 deinitialization 失败保留 request 或冷态 lease，直到同一个 owner 证明实际 drain。stop 在释放引脚或时钟前检查外设 enable、DMA 地址/计数及 pending/active IRQ 引用。只有这次撤回之后才能复用 Handle；需要时由官方 `HAL_DMA_Init` 恢复可复用 idle state，不手动赋值 READY。"

msgid "The production IRQ gate saves the incoming CPU mask for short state changes. If a relevant UART/DMA IRQ preempts a task HAL call, it disables only that selected vector, leaves its hardware fact pending and restores the vector when the retained HAL stack exits. It does not spin or let a level IRQ tail-chain indefinitely inside that task call. Every `HAL_DMA_IRQHandler` entry requires EN readback clear, including an IRQ with only HT or no observed error: an error can arrive after a flag snapshot. While EN remains set, an HT-only event is acknowledged and HTIE disabled with official primitives; its registered private no-op callback is not invoked and no transfer state advances. Observed errors or inconsistent terminal facts withdraw DMAT and request disable once. Refused disable masks that DMA vector and quarantines the borrow; task service retries and dispatches HAL only after EN is clear. This excludes the pinned handler's `SystemCoreClock/9600` wait (17,500 iterations at 168 MHz) from the selected IRQ path. This is a bounded-path design, not measured interrupt latency or WCET."
msgstr "生产 IRQ gate 为短状态变更保存调用前 CPU mask。相关 UART/DMA IRQ 抢占 task HAL 调用时，只禁用该选定 vector，保留其硬件 pending 事实，并在保留的 HAL 调用栈退出后恢复 vector。它不会自旋，也不会让 level IRQ 在该 task 调用中无限 tail-chain。每次进入 `HAL_DMA_IRQHandler` 都要求 EN 回读清零，包括只有 HT 或未观察到错误的 IRQ：错误可能在 flag 快照之后到达。EN 仍为置位时，只有 HT 的事件通过官方原语确认并禁用 HTIE；不调用已注册的私有 no-op callback，也不推进传输状态。观察到错误或不一致终态事实时，撤回 DMAT 并请求 disable 一次。disable 拒绝则屏蔽该 DMA vector 并 quarantine 借用；task service 重试，并仅在 EN 清零后分派 HAL。这样所选 IRQ 路径不会执行所锁定 handler 的 `SystemCoreClock/9600` 等待（168 MHz 时为 17,500 次迭代）。这是有界路径设计，不是已测中断延迟或 WCET。"

msgid "The target-private compile profile replaces CMSIS exclusive-retry RMW macros with one saved-mask word update. This profile requires a single CPU owner of the aligned UART control words and no NMI, fault/panic logger or other writer. It preserves the incoming mask and leaves vendor source unchanged. The same profile uses nearest OVER16 BRR rounding with overflow-safe quotient/remainder; cold validation rejects zero baud or an out-of-field divisor before UART enable. It does not grant dynamic clock or arbitrary format support."
msgstr "目标私有编译 profile 将 CMSIS exclusive-retry RMW 宏替换为一次保存 mask 的 word 更新。此 profile 要求对齐的 UART 控制 word 只有一个 CPU owner，且没有 NMI、fault/panic logger 或其他 writer。它保留调用前 mask，不修改 vendor 源码。同一 profile 使用最接近的 OVER16 BRR 舍入，以不会溢出的商/余数计算；冷态校验在 UART enable 之前拒绝零 baud 或超出字段范围的 divisor。它不授予动态时钟或任意格式支持。"

msgid "Only the selected HAL UART/DMA/RCC source units enter the provider's private build. `HAL_Init`, `HAL_InitTick` and a HAL SysTick handler are not selected. `HAL_GetTick` reads `uint32_t` milliseconds modulo `2^32` from the existing live TIM2 epoch; bootstrap retains its separate finite polling limits. `SystemCoreClock` follows the last confirmed 16 MHz HSI or 168 MHz PLL observation, including partial startup and cleanup failures. Official RCC frequency getters use the selected prescaler tables rather than a fabricated constant clock."
msgstr "只有所选 HAL UART/DMA/RCC 源单元进入 provider 私有构建。不选入 `HAL_Init`、`HAL_InitTick` 或 HAL SysTick handler。`HAL_GetTick` 从既有活动 TIM2 epoch 读取以 `uint32_t` 按 `2^32` 回绕的毫秒数；bootstrap 保留独立的有限轮询上限。`SystemCoreClock` 跟随最后确认的 16 MHz HSI 或 168 MHz PLL 观测，包括部分 startup 和 cleanup 失败。官方 RCC frequency getter 使用所选 prescaler 表，而不是虚构常量时钟。"

msgid "The actual adapter/official-source model and clock tests establish their recorded software scope. Generated factory execution, selected ARM/SDK links, stack/cycle comparisons and the complete current-source gate remain separate exits. Physical IRQ latency, wire timing and long-load HIL are not executed without connected equipment. Do not infer a resource improvement from vendor reuse or a passing model."
msgstr "实际 adapter/官方源码模型和时钟测试建立其已记录的软件范围。生成 factory 的执行、所选 ARM/SDK 链接、栈/周期比较及完整当前源码 gate 仍是分别验收的退出条件。没有连接设备时，不执行物理 IRQ latency、wire timing 和长期负载 HIL。不能从复用 vendor 代码或模型通过推断资源改善。"

msgid "A paired development ARM firmware measurement uses the same F407ZG baremetal `uart_rx_compact_assembly/f407-dma-tx.toml`, UART workload and `NX_UART_ID_UART1`, GCC 14.3 M4F hard-float, `-Os`, no LTO and compiler cache off. Both builds add measurement-only `-ffile-prefix-map=<each-source-root>=.` so different absolute source-root spellings in retained `__FILE__` diagnostics do not bias Flash cost. Their resolved configuration bytes are identical. The normalized pair is:"
msgstr "成对的开发 ARM 固件测量使用同一个 F407ZG 裸机 `uart_rx_compact_assembly/f407-dma-tx.toml`、UART workload 和 `NX_UART_ID_UART1`，以及 GCC 14.3 M4F hard-float、`-Os`、无 LTO、关闭编译缓存。两个构建都增加仅用于测量的 `-ffile-prefix-map=<each-source-root>=.`，避免保留的 `__FILE__` 诊断中不同绝对源码根路径的拼写影响 Flash 成本。二者解析配置字节相同。归一化成对结果如下："

