msgid "The ordinary new build without that measurement-only option loads 18,200 Flash bytes and uses 456 static RAM bytes. Both the ordinary build and normalized pair fit this fixture's 64 KiB Flash and 32 KiB static RAM budgets; MSP remains a separate 2,048-byte reservation and heap remains zero. This compares the complete increment, including clock metadata and shared RX changes, not isolated HAL overhead. The engineering decision favors reviewed official finite-TX reuse for this F407 mode at the explicit cost; it is not a memory/performance win or a mandate to use HAL for every family."
msgstr "不带该测量专用选项的普通新构建加载 18,200 字节 Flash，使用 456 字节静态 RAM。普通构建和归一化成对构建均满足此夹具的 64 KiB Flash 和 32 KiB 静态 RAM 预算；MSP 仍单独预留 2,048 字节，heap 仍为零。这里比较的是包括时钟元数据和共享 RX 变化的完整增量，不是单独 HAL 开销。工程决策是在明确成本下，为此 F407 模式优先复用已审查官方有限 TX；这不是内存/性能优势，也不要求每个系列都使用 HAL。"

msgid "The observed final ordinary ELF retains no `HAL_Init`, `HAL_InitTick`, `HAL_IncTick`, `HAL_RCC_ClockConfig` or `HAL_RCC_OscConfig`, and contains no exclusive instructions. These are observations of this image, not all possible callers. Stack high-water, execution cycles and physical behavior remain unmeasured. Final-source or other-configuration costs require their own ELF/map/resources."
msgstr "所观测最终普通 ELF 不保留 `HAL_Init`、`HAL_InitTick`、`HAL_IncTick`、`HAL_RCC_ClockConfig` 或 `HAL_RCC_OscConfig`，也没有 exclusive 指令。这些只描述该镜像，不适用于所有可能调用者。栈 high-water、执行周期和物理行为仍未测量。最终源码或其他配置的成本须分别取得 ELF/map/resources。"

msgid "Inspect each completion stack: F4 SPI DMA may wait for TXE/BSY; H7/U5 EOT hardware close must preserve the selected quiet interval before disabling the shifter. U575 HAL also contains its Device-gated persistent-DMAT workaround. These API fits do not prove callback, deadline or loan withdrawal; review ordinary LL/SPL setters separately from justified command/snapshot exceptions."
msgstr "逐一检查完成调用栈：F4 SPI DMA 可能等待 TXE/BSY；H7/U5 的 EOT 硬件关闭流程必须先保留所选静默间隔，再禁用移位器。U575 HAL 也已包含由 Device 条件宏控制的 persistent-DMAT workaround。这些 API 的适用点不能证明回调、deadline 或借用引用已排空；应将普通 LL/SPL setter 与有理由保留的命令／快照例外分别审查。"

msgid "SPI evaluation preserves the whole CS interval, dummy/discard, fixed DMA addresses and counts. GPIO needs one combined set/reset command; U5 `HAL_GPIO_WriteMultipleStatePin` supplies it outside the selected GPIO closure. Separate set/reset calls cannot substitute. DMA disable still needs actual readback and withdrawal proof before returning borrowed storage."
msgstr "SPI 评估须保留完整 CS 区间、dummy/discard、固定 DMA 地址和计数。GPIO 需要一次组合 set/reset 命令；U5 的 `HAL_GPIO_WriteMultipleStatePin` 已提供该操作，但不在当前所选 GPIO 闭包内。分开的 set/reset 调用不能替代它。DMA disable 仍须有实际读回与撤离证明，才能归还被借用的存储。"

msgid "The [SPI cost fixture](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tests/contracts/io_storage_cost/spi_endpoints/README.md) links 0/1/2/4 endpoints against the unchanged `89485943` Source SDK: development LOAD/footprint is 3,048/7,880/7,940/8,064 B, with static SRAM 72/176/208/280 B, plus 2,048 B MSP and zero heap. Nonzero images consume public controller topology; the four-way image uses three CS banks, so its delta is not a linear endpoint cost. These link observations do not establish timing, HIL or new-source qualification."
msgstr "[SPI 成本夹具](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tests/contracts/io_storage_cost/spi_endpoints/README.md)使用未改变的 `89485943` Source SDK 链接 0/1/2/4 个 endpoint：开发测量的 LOAD 与 footprint 均为 3,048/7,880/7,940/8,064 B，静态 SRAM 为 72/176/208/280 B，另有 2,048 B MSP，heap 为零。非零配置消费公共 controller 拓扑；四 endpoint 镜像使用三个 CS bank，因此其增量不能作为线性的单 endpoint 成本。这些链接观察不建立时序、HIL 或新源码资格。"

msgid "The next development overlay adds H743 `hal_driver_h7` to the family descriptor and SoC source-lock projection, matching its existing pinned LL build input. Private capture, advanced-PWM and UART-FIFO templates retain specialization contracts; pin-state has optional implementation/default-macro scoping, while CAN FD remains an ordinary guarded declaration. Separate U575 SPI byte ports now take the selected controller and directly call private LL functions, with no runtime forwarding. These changes do not rewrite the frozen source review."
msgstr "后续开发 overlay 在 H743 family descriptor 与 SoC source-lock 投影中加入 `hal_driver_h7`，与既有已锁定 LL 构建输入一致。私有 capture、advanced-PWM 与 UART-FIFO 模板继续遵守各自的 specialization 合同；pin-state 提供可选 implementation 与默认宏作用域，而 CAN FD 仍是普通的、有 include guard 保护的声明。独立的 U575 SPI byte port 现在接收所选 controller 并直接调用私有 LL 函数，没有运行时转发。这些改动不重写已冻结源码审查的结论。"

msgid "The source review at `89485943` preserves all 217 declared identities, including 33 without selected fixtures and 19 Native MODEL rows; absent selection remains unassessed. Optional components/system owners and authorized private examples need separate review; this view changes neither support nor qualification."
msgstr "`89485943` 的源码审查保留全部 217 个已声明身份，其中包括 33 个未被夹具选中的身份和 19 个 Native MODEL 条目；缺少选择的条目仍为未评估。可选组件／系统责任方以及经授权的私有示例需要分别审查；此视图不改变支持范围或资格。"
